              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "شباهت داشتن (shebâhat dâshtan) — \"to resemble, to look like\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "او خیلی به مادرش شباهت دارد. u kheyli be mâdarash shebâhat dârad. She looks a lot like her mother."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "be kasi shebâhat dâshtan; shebâhat 'likeness' + dâshtan 'to have'. It shares a root with shabih 'similar'."
            }
          ]
        },
