            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ما با همسایه ها زیاد رفت و آمد میکنیم. mâ bâ hamsâyehâ ziyâd raft-o âmad mikonim. We see a lot of our neighbours."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "raft 'going' + o 'and' + âmad 'coming' (the past stems of raftan and âmadan) + kardan."
            }
          ]
        },
