          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "raft-o âmad is built on two inherited past stems, raft from raftan, 'to go', and âmad from âmadan, 'to come': coming and going. kardan is inherited too."
            }
